{"unit_id":"huimingli666__dsh-workspace-auto-sort#card-zh","repo":"huimingli666/dsh-workspace-auto-sort","commit":"246817f8f19fa7044d634b07a9cce7b385394b1c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-auto-sort 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面端的工作区自动排序插件，在宿主进程监听会话活动，并通过 workspaceRegistry 的持久化接口重排侧边栏工作区。它默认依据用户消息时间计算新近程度，也可按所有会话事件排序；支持选择全部或仅最外层工作区参与，并以防抖合并连续活动。插件还提供本机状态查询与手动重排接口，适合希望常用工作区自动置顶且顺序重启后保留的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号；需要 DSH 宿主服务，默认在本地日志目录记录重排信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:28-45","src/index.js:227-263","src/routes.js:69-109"]}
{"unit_id":"huimingli666__dsh-workspace-auto-sort#card-en","repo":"huimingli666/dsh-workspace-auto-sort","commit":"246817f8f19fa7044d634b07a9cce7b385394b1c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-workspace-auto-sort sorts DSH workspaces by session activity and persists the order. It supports user-message or all-event ranking, all or outermost workspaces, and local status and manual reorder routes. No API key is needed; host services are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:28-45","src/index.js:227-263","src/routes.js:69-109"]}
